## [1.0.3] - 2026-08-16
## Fixed
-- commented out a line of code that was causing problems. This was: "Filter out rows where 'C' (Carbon count) is 0, added 07/16/26 df = df[df['C'] > 0].copy()". This was added to remove salts, as they had been included in some testing data. However, it also removes H2O and OH, which messes up the O/C and H/C. 
